oles and the problem of uniqueness in general relativity","volume":"58","author":"Dafermos","year":"2005","journal-title":"Commun. Pure Appl. Math."},{"key":"cqgaadbcfbib014","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","first-page":"729","DOI":"10.1007\/s00220-014-2063-4","type":"journal-article","article-title":"Black holes without spacelike singularities","volume":"332","author":"Dafermos","year":"2014","journal-title":"Commun. Math. Phys."},{"key":"cqgaadbcfbib015","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1103\/PhysRevD.97.104060","type":"journal-article","article-title":"Strong cosmic censorship in de Sitter space","volume":"97","author":"Dias","year":"2018","journal-title":"Phys. Rev. D"},{"key":"cqgaadbcfbib016","article-title":"The interior of dynamical vacuum black holes I: the C0-stability of the Kerr Cauchy horizon","author":"Dafermos","year":"2017","type":"preprint"},{"key":"cqgaadbcfbib017","article-title":"The wave equation on Schwarzschild\u2013de Sitter spacetimes","author":"Dafermos","year":"2007","type":"preprint"},{"key":"cqgaadbcfbib018","first-page":"371","type":"journal-article","article-title":"A scattering theory for the wave equation on Kerr black hole exteriors","volume":"51","author":"Dafermos","year":"2018","journal-title":"Ann. Sci. l\u2019ENS"},{"key":"cqgaadbcfbib019","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","first-page":"985","DOI":"10.1007\/s00220-016-2771-z","type":"journal-article","article-title":"Time-translation invariance of scattering maps and blue-shift instabilities on Kerr black hole spacetimes","volume":"350","author":"Dafermos","year":"2017","journal-title":"Commun. Math. Phys."},{"key":"cqgaadbcfbib020","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","first-page":"119","DOI":"10.1007\/s00220-011-1286-x","type":"journal-article","article-title":"Quasi-normal modes and exponential energy decay for the Kerr\u2013de Sitter black hole","volume":"306","author":"Dyatlov","year":"2011","journal-title":"Commun. Math. Phys."},{"key":"cqgaadbcfbib021","doi-asserted-by":"publi